  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The past matches the subject",
   "texto": [
    "The past does not change according to the person, but it is in line with **género y número con el sujeto**. With я and ты, the form depends on the gender of the person who speaks or receives the question.",
    "With many verbs **-ть** is removed and **-л** (masculine singular), **-ла** (feminine singular), **-ло** (singular neutral) or **-ли** (plural) is added.",
    "работать → **работал** (masculine subject), **работала** (feminine), **работало** (neutral), **работали** (plural).",
    "Some verbs are irregular: идти forma **шёл, шла, шло, шли**."
   ]
  },
